WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.400
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.480
<i>How could something like this happen?</i>

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.720
<i>Hurry back, Kouji. Please.</i>

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:32.350
Kouji?

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.570
I don't want to die.

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:44.070
I really don't want to die.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.440
I want to continue living.

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.410
I don't want to die.

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.710
I don't wanna die!

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:00.920
Why...?

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:08.090
KOUJI!!

00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:14.870
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:21.740
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:25.750
Although loneliness...

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:30.080
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:37.320
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:42.400
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:45.370
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:52.900
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:56.680
...the dream and the reality...

00:01:56.680 --> 00:02:00.310
...that you saw cross paths

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:04.010
Some light is shed...

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:08.590
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:15.830
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:23.830
The things I want have no shape

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:32.240
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:46.530
Kouji Aiba

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:48.460
A spatial void deficiency?

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:50.800
The spatial gap of the plasma area
is decreasing at a significant rate!

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:54.560
This image... you mean to say
we've entered a huge bubble?

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:57.330
Kevin, get me information on the area
surrounding us, from the control section.

00:02:57.640 --> 00:02:58.840
How come?

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:01.740
Ordinary space existing in Sere 7?

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:04.110
I'm more concerned about what those are.

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:06.080
What a spectacle.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:09.340
This is no joke. No matter how you
look at that, it's a living creature!

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:11.780
I can't believe such a creature exists!

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.680
So that light spot we saw then
wasn't our imagination.

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:17.690
What's wrong?

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:19.930
Nothing.

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:23.460
A warp is being caused in the gravitational
field by that big one in the middle.

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:25.170
Warp in the gravitational field?

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:28.160
What? The Ryvius was built using this...!

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:29.430
Pinger reacting!

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:32.600
- What?
- Object approaching from outside the spot.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.580
Speed has increased to above 750!

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:35.940
That's unheard of!

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:38.100
Gravitational field warp
also confirmed from the moving object!

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:39.870
An enemy?

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:44.950
<i>Large object in sight.</i>
<i>Fore, 120, 135, 151!</i>

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:50.320
<i>Gamma rays and Mu in sight.</i>

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:55.720
<i>Switch to visual screen after charging!</i>

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:01.370
Kouji? No! This can't happen!

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:03.730
Kouji! Kouji!!

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:06.270
Wake up. Please, Kouji!

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.940
Come to your senses!

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:13.740
- He's been shot.
- Why, that wound...!

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:16.680
He's been shot,
which means... there's a gun?

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:18.150
The one that Blue had?

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:19.720
No...!

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:24.690
Are there any students here
who were posted in the nursing section?

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:31.800
Criff, you're in nursing, right?

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:38.210
Faina!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.570
Where are you going?

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:44.740
I'm only going to the bridge.
Can you wait for me here?

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.380
S-Sure.

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:49.350
Reiko. I advise that you stay in the room.

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:51.790
Otherwise if anyone found you,
I couldn't guarantee your safety.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.750
I understand.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.660
<i>Why did I run away then?</i>

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.620
<i>It's a lie! It's a lie that</i>
<i>one's past cannot be erased.</i>

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:08.860
<i>I've always done so.</i>
<i>I've always completely parted with my past.</i>

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:12.270
<i>That's why I'm living the present.</i>
<i>I can't deny that now.</i>

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:16.040
<i>I know Ikumi will guide me</i>
<i>to my future.</i>

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:20.810
The target believed to be an enemy
will enter the spot in about one hour.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.850
What about sending out
the Vital Guarder?

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:25.190
- There's still plenty of time for that!
- What'll we do about the squids?

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:27.120
As long as they don't come at us,
we can ignore them!

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:30.920
It has the formation
of a quasi-Schwarzschild.

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:33.290
You're kidding.
Not even the Vital Guarder has this!

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.890
Are you saying it has a greater output
than the Ryvius?

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:37.900
Probably more than double.

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:41.900
- Marco, go on ahead.
- All right.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.010
<i>Kouji.</i>

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:53.370
<i>It can't be you.</i>

00:05:56.650 --> 00:06:00.980
<i>It can't be you!</i>
<i>It just shouldn't be you!</i>

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:06.230
- What's wrong?
- It's nothing.

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:12.500
I-I can't do it. I lack the brains.
Ask someone else.

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:15.390
There is no one else.
It's a matter of life and death.

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.170
Please.

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:19.310
I don't think I can do it.

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:22.140
I'll help. Let's save Kouji's life together.

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:24.080
- But...!
- Please!

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:26.670
Save Kouji's life.

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:29.810
O-Okay.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.460
What's the matter?

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:43.430
It looks like we're going to battle again.

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:48.770
Protect me, will you?

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:51.070
Of course I will. I'll do anything.

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:55.570
I <i>can</i> do anything.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:57.840
But you know...

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:00.350
...this enemy appears to be more
powerful than any we've faced.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:02.720
- I want you to come with me.
- I'm going outside?

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:04.680
It's so that I can protect you.

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:08.020
Yeah. All right. I'm going with you.

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:11.080
Because I believe in you.

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:13.850
Thank you.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:17.620
That's all I needed to hear.

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:19.900
<i>Attention to all aboard.</i>

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:24.060
<i>We have concluded that the unidentified</i>
<i>object confirmed earlier is an enemy.</i>

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:26.870
<i>We will commence battle against it.</i>

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:30.100
<i>All battle personnel are to act promptly</i>
<i>in accordance to the manual.</i>

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:36.280
<i>Partitions closest to the outer wall</i>
<i>will be lowered in fifteen minutes. I repeat...</i>

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:39.380
It's A-34!
- Sorry.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:42.080
Your mind seems to be elsewhere.
It's not like you.

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:48.930
I see.

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:51.160
This route existed.

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:53.130
We'll proceed on our
own from this point on.

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:54.870
We may get caught, after all.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:57.800
- Juli!
- You mustn't come! Ran, take care of Pat.

00:07:58.140 --> 00:07:59.040
Okay.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.480
I'll go too. You'll need the
extra help if something happens.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:02.310
But...!

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:05.780
- Don't worry. I've got a great idea.
- Huh?

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:07.750
<i>I'll check for internal responses again.</i>

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:12.150
<i>Try sending the virtual control signal.</i>

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:15.780
- Sorry I'm late.
- Ikumi, what took you...?

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:26.060
How much time before the
Lift Ship detachment?

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:28.490
Ah, right. Another 12 minutes.

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:29.840
And the Barge Cannon?

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:30.960
I'm having Stein get that ready.

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:32.760
<i>That girl!</i>

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:37.710
Hey! What are you doing?
We're preparing for battle!

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:41.080
I'm Kevin Green of Zwei.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:43.050
We're in the midst of a confidential operation
under Ikumi's orders.

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:45.110
It's confidential, so it's a secret.

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:47.320
I-I see.

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:55.190
- See? Worked like a charm.
- Y-Yeah.

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:02.860
Please give me instructions. I'll help.

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:05.340
Um, well... we'd better check
the wound first.

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:07.370
So I should set up the scanner, right?

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:09.340
Y-Yes, that should be fine.

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:16.380
Oh, no. It's really low.

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:19.110
<i>Stable at plus or minus 0.5.</i>

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:22.450
Increase Gespenst's speed to maximum
while maintaining our present course.

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:25.380
Don't give them any time
to prepare their stance!

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:28.830
The enemy ship is accelerating.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.630
Ikumi. What about the Vital Guarder?

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:33.070
- Seven minutes to take off!
- That's gonna be too late!

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:34.160
The enemy has appeared!

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.510
- <i>We've entered the indicated coordinates!</i>
- <i>Activating!</i>

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:43.000
- <i>The Geduld density is 2800...!</i>
- <i>Ryvius... 10 to the minus 5 power.</i>

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:46.500
<i>Immediately scan forward</i>
<i>with both radars!</i>

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.480
- It <i>is</i> the same type ship as ours.
- We'll hit as we cross paths again!

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:53.880
It'll be all right! It'll be all right!

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:02.030
- The number keeps falling.
- Be quiet!

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.990
Three minutes to contact.

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:09.720
Do something, Yuki!

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:26.450
Captain! Our ship will also be affected
if we continue on this course!

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:29.120
Never mind! The Bratica is in our sight!

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:33.120
Hey! Kevin's on the bridge!

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:34.490
- You tricked us!
- They've caught on.

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:35.620
30 more seconds!

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:38.560
Who are you? What are you doing?

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:40.970
- Open up!
- W-We're doomed!

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:43.900
Open up! Open up at once!

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:48.040
Ikumi!

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:52.070
Kouji.

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:55.350
I don't want to die.

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:57.820
<i>Concentrate the energy in a
<i>single point of the aiming field.</i></i>

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.810
<i>Hold the edge and curve it</i>
<i>down to 260 percent!</i>

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:02.650
I'll cut you up into pieces!

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:06.130
I don't want to die.

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:09.160
I don't wanna die!

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:18.960
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.040
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:39.050
What an impact.

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:41.490
As we thought, this isn't like
the other enemies we faced!

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:43.900
- <i>Have you checked for damages?!</i>
- <i>I'll check the Lift Ship!</i>

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:45.130
What's the situation over there?

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:46.800
<i>We're currently checking.</i>

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:49.470
How's Kouji?

00:11:57.910 --> 00:11:59.440
I got them all.

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:02.250
Kouji...!

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:04.680
All we need to do now is stop the bleeding.
How are you holding up there?

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:06.080
It's become quiet outside.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.450
They probably were
startled enough to flee.

00:12:10.490 --> 00:12:13.520
<i>Sections 267 through 321 are</i>
<i>pretty well all destroyed.</i>

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:17.130
<i>I'm guessing that their field ripped</i>
<i>through us at an acute angle upon contact.</i>

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:18.470
- <i>88% of the systems are completely down!</i>
- Any casualties?

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:20.100
- <i>I estimate at least twenty people.</i>

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.930
- <i>28% is severely damaged!</i>

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.640
<i>60% of this power system</i>
<i>is somehow operative.</i>

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:26.370
<i>What about the energy supply level?</i>

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:27.970
<i>It's only capable of</i>
<i>maintaining operational environment now!</i>

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:29.740
We're sending out the Vital Guarder!

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:31.110
Don't be ridiculous.

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:33.080
<i>Half of our terminals are busted</i>
<i>from that impact.</i>

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:35.950
- <i>We need time to transfer our data!</i>
- <i>Damn!</i>

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:37.920
If we take into account that the enemy
has also suffered damage...

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:39.890
...I'd say we have some
time to work with.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:42.620
Th-The s-s-squids!

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:45.230
They're headed straight for the enemy?

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:47.330
- They must've pissed them off.
- Who cares what the reason is?

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:49.490
Go, squids! Get 'em! Ram into them!

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.420
Captain! I suggest we change our course.

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:57.170
Keep our route fixed,
and head directly at the Bratica!

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:59.570
- However...!
- Why should a Vaia or two matter?

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:02.400
Have you forgotten the
abilities of this Grey Gespenst?

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:03.570
Straight ahead!

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:16.320
The squids are running into the enemy!

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:34.070
They're... absorbing the squids!

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:35.380
How the hell...!

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:36.900
...are we supposed to fight against that?

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:42.240
That's impossible. It's unscientific.

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:45.110
I, I will not acknowledge this!

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:52.320
We're at an overwhelming
disadvantage fighting in this area.

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:54.160
<i>I advise that we retreat.</i>

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:56.090
<i>I don't want to keep my eyes on that thing!</i>

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.860
All right. Ascend to ordinary space at once!

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:04.860
Why?

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.630
Why do you hate me so much?

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.440
I've done nothing wrong.

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:19.710
I'm right, aren't I?

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:24.120
I want to escape. I want to live.

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:26.490
I don't want to die. I want to survive.

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:28.720
I'd hate to die.

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:31.160
I don't like pain.

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.160
Right.

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:34.830
I know. I understand.

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:40.200
I feel the same way.

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:46.710
We're still accelerating.

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:48.270
Does this ship still possess
additional power?

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:51.240
At this rate, we should escape
to ordinary space within half a day.

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:53.350
- We can get away, can't we?
- Yeah.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:56.250
Hey. If all goes well, can I kiss you?

00:14:58.360 --> 00:14:59.290
Sure.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:00.290
Hey!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:02.280
There's some commotion
going on within the ship.

00:15:02.530 --> 00:15:03.260
Again?

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:05.430
What's going on in the back of the ship?

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:07.130
This enemy's tougher than the others, right?

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.000
Let us on the Lift Ship too.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:11.540
- You told us that you'd protect us!
- Will you betray us again and let us die?

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:13.100
- We demand that you open the gates!
- Open it!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:17.910
<i>Heiger. Evacuate everyone</i>
<i>aboard onto the Lift Ship!</i>

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:20.550
<i>The hangar beneath the main room</i>
<i>should be able to take everyone!</i>

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:21.680
As you request.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:23.880
We shall begin directing the students
right away, starting with Class A.

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:27.180
I'll raise the lowered partitions
in the order of Class.

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:31.020
Now, hurry on in order, guys!
Beginning with those in Class A!

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:34.190
Behave yourselves, if you don't wanna
get in trouble with Ikumi!

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:36.860
Fu, what'll we do if Blue comes?

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:41.200
He won't come. Every person here
is his enemy. Including us.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:45.070
Well, I'd be happier if he did come.
It would give me a chance for payback.

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:48.510
How is Kouji doing?

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.940
I've done everything I can.

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:52.570
The rest is up to Kouji.

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.510
All we can do is wait.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.990
Kouji. Wake up.

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.830
Even if it's with a frown on your face.
Insult me if you want. Just look at me.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.000
Please, Kouji.

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:14.390
I love you, Kouji. I love you.

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:17.600
I really do. So please!

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.010
We've risen to ordinary space.

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:23.510
I'm returning all systems to normal.

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:25.340
Hey, I can see a planet.

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:28.040
Calculating our distance from the sun...!

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:30.770
I'm certain. That's Uranus.

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:34.180
At the Ryvius's current speed, we can cover
the distance to Uranus in less than a day.

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:35.920
How about it, Chic?

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:38.650
Huh? Pinger reacting!

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:41.190
You're kidding!
Has it already caught up to us?

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:45.630
<i>Load is decreasing at a significant rate.</i>
<i>Confirmed we have broken the surface!</i>

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:49.700
<i>All radars back in working order!</i>
<i>Activated automatic pursuing system.</i>

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:54.110
<i>Radar presently scanning all areas.</i>

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:58.440
How unsightly of you!
Still trying to escape? Bratica!

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:08.850
This is crazy!

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:11.860
If we send the Vital Guarder out,
our field won't hold.

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:13.950
We should also move to the Lift Ship.

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:15.800
- R-Right.
- Let's go!

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:17.320
What about the crew
for the Barge cannon?

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:19.330
I've programmed it to
disconnect automatically.

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:21.000
What about the partitions?

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:22.970
They should all go up in order,
on a time delay!

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:26.860
Wait for me!

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.240
Wasn't that Michelle?

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.230
Our top priority now
is to escape from here!

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:34.280
I said wait!
Are you all planning on leaving me behind?

00:17:37.180 --> 00:17:38.220
Huh?

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:40.690
- Why are the partitions...?
- Could it be...?

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:44.850
Open it! Let us out!

00:17:48.490 --> 00:17:50.760
Twenty percent critical output.

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:52.200
When will Geist be ready for take off?

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:53.400
Within about thirty minutes.

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:58.100
Twenty minutes! Don't forget that
Sphix-to-Sphix, theirs is superior!

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:00.710
How's the evacuation coming?

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:03.970
Everyone's been evacuated.
We will head up there to support you.

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:06.350
Are you absolutely sure
that everyone has escaped?

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:07.310
<i>Yes.</i>

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:15.150
There's no one around.

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:17.520
There were some Guardian members
lying unconscious. What's going on?

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:19.820
Hey! We have a problem!

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:22.930
Juli. It appears that the Lift Ship
has left with everyone on it!

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:24.360
- What?
- Ikumi, that bastard!

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:25.990
He has without a doubt betrayed us!

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:44.280
They say the Vital Guarder has already left.

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:47.820
- Are we gonna die here?
- No! I can't accept that!

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:50.850
Faina. Have you made us your past?

00:18:52.390 --> 00:18:54.990
I've got no place to go!

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:58.660
<i>Windy unit. Circes unit.</i>

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:00.570
- <i>Proceed to take over the Bratica.</i>
- <i>Geist will attack Einvalt.</i>

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:03.000
<i>Increasing output by 160 percent.</i>

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:06.810
<i>Developing gravitational field</i>
<i>at the factor of 62.</i>

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:09.040
<i>Locks on Geist released.</i>

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:10.910
<i>The enemy's sending</i>
<i>out its Vital Guarder!</i>

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.170
<i>Damn it! Uranus is right in front of us!</i>

00:19:13.810 --> 00:19:15.210
How many shots left in the Barge?

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:16.810
West 6, east 4.

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:20.680
Kreis! You control all sub-solids.

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:22.890
Sub-room 7, 12...

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:25.150
<i>...13, 17, and 19, switch members!</i>

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:27.450
Hey, get outta my way!

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:33.570
There's no one here!

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:35.930
I told you. We've been abandoned.

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:38.900
Everyone, help out.
I'll confirm our current position.

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:41.260
- Ran, check the situation aboard the ship!
- Right!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.070
We have no protective field!

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.250
- <i>Send me the mobile!</i>
- <i>I got it!</i>

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:53.220
<i>Prepare to fire while I hold them off.</i>

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:55.050
Send A 6, 8, and 12 to Yuki!

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:58.960
- As long as we can defeat that thing!
- I'll send it over to you, so don't miss!

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:01.260
Do you seriously think that I'd miss?

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:06.900
The enemy Vital Guarder!

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:08.190
Is the cannon loaded?

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:13.160
Where's their Sphix?

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:16.210
Ikumi!

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:18.580
I'm protecting her, no matter what!
Kozue! My sister!

00:20:19.210 --> 00:20:20.780
Yuki!

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:24.550
I can't be defeated! I'll show them!
And then I'll grasp it all! Everything!

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:26.650
My future...!

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.260
Take this!

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:44.770
- Are we battling an enemy?
- Probably.

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:46.430
It won't start! The field won't develop!

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:48.110
Can't we increase the output?

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:50.110
It's enough just trying to maintain
gravity on board!

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:51.580
Where's the Vital Guarder?

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:54.380
We're being attacked?

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:00.890
What's this? Are we being captured?

00:21:00.890 --> 00:21:02.460
Can I help out with anything?

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:03.920
Leave things here to me.

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:07.620
We'll leave things as is on board,
and escape the battle zone.

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:11.350
I don't know how to build
a route-altering solid. Would you do it, Ran?

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:14.430
- Sure thing!
- Hey! We have a transmission!

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:23.740
<i>I-It's me. Kouji Aiba.</i>

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:28.210
Kouji! But what are you doing there?
You should still be...!

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:31.420
I want to go to the Lift Ship.

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:34.110
Please cooperate with me.

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:36.850
- <i>Are you out of your mind?</i>
- Please!

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:39.760
I must go there no matter what.

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:47.100
I need to... get a message across!

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:51.770
Yes.

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:53.740
I need to get a message across...

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:05.550
...to you.

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:12.310
In your dry eyes...

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:17.380
...a silhouette appears

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:22.090
The blue colored future...

00:22:22.090 --> 00:22:28.820
...swayed and glittered

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:38.240
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:46.850
...freedom out of pity

00:22:46.850 --> 00:22:55.290
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:55.290 --> 00:22:59.190
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:05.560
goodbye

00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:11.120
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:12.460
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: In Order to Stay as Myself

00:23:12.460 --> 00:23:15.690
Next episode: In Order to Stay as Myself
As the battle against Gespenst intensified...

00:23:15.690 --> 00:23:19.400
Next episode: In Order to Stay as Myself
...I headed for the Lift Ship with Aoi.

00:23:19.400 --> 00:23:22.270
Next episode: In Order to Stay as Myself
On that ship is everything
that I must confront...

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:24.570
Next episode: In Order to Stay as Myself
...face to face.

00:23:24.570 --> 00:23:26.140
Next episode: In Order to Stay as Myself
Therefore...

00:23:26.140 --> 00:23:27.940
Next episode: In Order to Stay as Myself
...in order to stay as myself...

00:23:27.940 --> 00:23:29.570
Next episode: In Order to Stay as Myself
...I now...!
